From ab01a238ebdda0623acae1eebb9a721d7d71e293 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter Hawkins <phawkins@google.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:39:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add large buffer regression test for psum_scatter.

Adds test_psum_scatter_large to multiprocess all_reduce_test to verify
that psum_scatter correctly handles large buffer transfers across devices,
guarded by jaxlib_extension_version >= 496.

[XLA] Clarify the API contract of ReduceScatter on xla::Communicator.

Fixes https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/40830
Fixes https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/40831

PiperOrigin-RevId: 986204115
---
